    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 17:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.17.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.17.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 17:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Uba kulethwa kini indaba elahlulayo ekwahluleleni kwenu, indaba yokubulala, loba eyelungelo lomuntu, loba eyokutshayana, loba izindaba zokuphikisana emizini yenu, lizakusuka liye endaweni iNkosi uNkulunkulu wenu ezakuyikhetha, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.17.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.17.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 17:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "liye kubapristi abangamaLevi lakumahluleli ozakuba ekhona ngalezonsuku, libabikele ukuze balitshele isiqumo sabo sokwahlulela. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.17.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.17.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 17:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lizakwenza njengesiqumo sabo abazakulitshela sona endaweni iNkosi ezayikhetha; linanzelele ukwenza konke njengokulilaya kwabo; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.17.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.17.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 17:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "lenze njengokulitshela kwabo lanjengesiqumo abalitshela sona; lingaphambukeli ngakwesokunene langakwesokhohlo kwesiqumo abalitshela sona. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.17.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.17.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 17:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Umuntu oziqhenyayo ongalaleli umpristi ophetheyo inkonzo phambi kweNkosi uNkulunkulu wenu, longalaleli umahluleli, uzakubulawa. Ngalokhu lizakuqeda ububi koIsrayeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.17.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.17.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 17:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bonke abantu bazakuzwa, besabe, bangaphindi ukuziqhenya.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.17.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.17.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
